## E2E Tested

### legend-interactivity

_Auto-tested via Playwright._

What to test:

- Hover a legend item — pointer cursor is shown.
- Click a legend item — an alert appears and no series are toggled.
- Paginate to page 2/2, repeat hover and click — alert still appears.
- Return to page 1/2 and repeat — alert still appears.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Legend Interactivity" name="legend-interactivity" type="generated" /%}

### legend-pagination-resize

_Auto-tested via Playwright._

What to test:

- Shrink the window width until only one legend item is visible, then until none are.
- Grow the width back until one item is visible and click the paginator next button — legend advances to page 2.

